Description: Region-Centric Integration for Single-Cell Multi-Omics. 
    This package provides an end-to-end pipeline for processing RNA, DNA methylation, and chromatin accessibility data. 
    It features ultra-fast data aggregation, quality control, dimensionality reduction, and multi-omics integration. 
    Additionally, it offers extensive publication-ready visualization tools.
